354893_2123985974762689_1544591742969265917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B4Ye3g9UX2YQ7kNvwHfwFTE&_nc_oc=AdpczYbo5SbfrWn6LB2ion24ZVnPHWKV2G8cwfVCOX4ZcenUvIEz7PXDcUx7fWa5mbw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTzaOXB-T-tWU8obhTpmcdnzAL3Wy0bdgZcbQy9x8lwOQ&oe=6AFB3B63"}, {"file_name": "image4.png", "id": "1479678613042418", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300750_1479678616375751_6997581480530838541_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qr-Z-omywQMQ7kNvwH6mh8t&_nc_oc=Ados4E_wG4_Bmv42S2VWiL-tIh12r6MxzxKLai8ufyGIkP5BBIOp1lm37zq-5fkn1Ts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSXOHGqZjBV3djBeoK5f42USwzq33oEAGe2BwL9EejSPA&oe=6AFB3A70"}, {"file_name": "image5.png", "id": "1245528793651676", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499349371_1245528796985009_3447873084062975841_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4EQHHIDEvesQ7kNvwHTODCM&_nc_oc=AdoKqXwFoqWRro6xdwVYQITaDYodVlNRWGDRy2Lz0klktSQkgDjp8GTPXuzi6he0Jno&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTTFWHryDekOiy3_ztEvZgthY1H9ZPdLcacx_gy7IzmcQ&oe=6AFB392D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hero360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely during a fire\u2014whether or not a smoke alarm is present. The name \u201cHERO\u201d reflects the purpose of the app: to empower users to become their own hero by learning life-saving reflexes and making the right decisions in a high-risk situation. Surviving a fire starts with knowledge and preparation\u2014HERO 360 gives users the chance to practice that before it\u2019s real.", "short_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely dur